+## Authentication
+
+Send `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. Keys are `apiKeys: [{ key, name, role }]`
+in the data. A missing or unknown key is 401 `unauthorized`; a known key
+whose role may not make the request is 403 `forbidden`. Roles: `viewer`
+(GET), `cook` (also `POST /recipes/:id/cook`, `POST /batches/:id/waste`,
+`POST /temperatures`, `POST /stocktakes/:id/counts`), `manager` (all).
+
+## Routes
+
+Listed in `README.md`. Also: `GET /audit` (managers only) returns
+`[{ at, key, method, path, status }]`, newest first, one entry per
+authenticated request that is not a GET.
+
